      "seed": 1106172592,
      "version": 6240,
      "versionNonce": 914611584,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1765108727984,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Functional Requirements:  \n- User can set their preferences(age, gender, radius)\n- User can view stack of profiles(potential matches)\n- User can swipe left/right(Yes/No) for a potential match\n- Two users swipe right, gets match notification \n\n--- Bonus --------\nNot showing repeated profiles in the stack \n\n---- out of scope ----------\n- creating a full profile with images videos prompts ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Functional Requirements:  \n- User can set their preferences(age, gender, radius)\n- User can view stack of profiles(potential matches)\n- User can swipe left/right(Yes/No) for a potential match\n- Two users swipe right, gets match notification \n\n--- Bonus --------\nNot showing repeated profiles in the stack \n\n---- out of scope ----------\n- creating a full profile with images videos prompts ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "b3QeLqnLHsxkexeN17H12",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1534.6118253264783,
