    {
      "id": "_ywwz_CtZIWSp99dU_mD4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 734.2665723697526,
      "y": 531.4658610267452,
      "width": 722.897812590283,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eebefa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1423259250,
      "version": 1176,
      "versionNonce": 2051702144,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1765108727984,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) Non Functional Requirements (SPARCS):  \n- Scalability: Highly scalable in terms of number of user actions(swipes),\npotential match generations \n- Low Latency: Low latency in terms of the stack generation \n- Availability: highly available in terms of preference setting, match stack\ngeneration \n- Consistency: highly consistent in terms of the match making\n\n3) Core Entities \n- User\n- Profile \n- Match ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) Non Functional Requirements (SPARCS):  \n- Scalability: Highly scalable in terms of number of user actions(swipes), potential match generations \n- Low Latency: Low latency in terms of the stack generation \n- Availability: highly available in terms of preference setting, match stack generation \n- Consistency: highly consistent in terms of the match making\n\n3) Core Entities \n- User\n- Profile \n- Match ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "A2P4AILlBEj0BXizHjARR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 730.7605346912519,
      "y": 860.986818925092,
      "width": 677.3297581895206,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eebefa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 408070254,
      "version": 864,
      "versionNonce": 387894656,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1765108727984,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4) API Design \n\nPOST/users/profile\n    Input: {name, userData, preferenceData}\n    Output: 2xx\n\nGET/stacks?lat={lat}&long={long}\n    Output: 2xx, {partial<profile>[]}\n\nPOST/users/swipe\n    Input: {action: Yes| No}\n\n-- For match notification we use pushNotification mechanism via\nserver. Need to look more into this",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4) API Design \n\nPOST/users/profile\n    Input: {name, userData, preferenceData}\n    Output: 2xx\n\nGET/stacks?lat={lat}&long={long}\n    Output: 2xx, {partial<profile>[]}\n\nPOST/users/swipe\n    Input: {action: Yes| No}\n\n-- For match notification we use pushNotification mechanism via server. Need to look more into this",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
