      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1765093562686,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5) We find all the posts from a given user by adding a GSI to the Post table with the\ncreatorID as the partition key and the post's creation timestamp createdAt as the sort\nkey. This will allow us to quickly pull all the posts from a set of users in chronological order.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5) We find all the posts from a given user by adding a GSI to the Post table with the creatorID as the partition key and the post's creation timestamp createdAt as the sort key. This will allow us to quickly pull all the posts from a set of users in chronological order.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
